w the Styles & themes section of the Workbench Product Kit page as built from Adapter Widgets only: the ordered stylesheets the Preview loads and the root attributes each Workspace theme sets on the Preview document, with their draft, validation, conflict and save states.","interactionRules":["Styles are an ordered list of specifiers: add, edit, move up or down and remove; a specifier is a package CSS export or a ./ path to a CSS file inside kit/, and a bad one is named under its field.","Map a theme adds one of the Workspace themes not yet mapped; each mapped theme lists the root attributes it sets on the Preview document, and an attribute name must be class or a lowercase data- name.","A draft shows an unsaved count with Discard and Save changes; saving is a compare-and-swap on the Product Kit file, a concurrent change raises a conflict that keeps the draft with Reload theirs and Compare, and a refused save names the reason and keeps the draft.","A theme mapped in the file that is not a Workspace theme says so."],"references":[{"label":"Phase 5 of the closed loop: dogfood coverage of the four core surfaces","relation":"decision","type":"external","uri":"https://github.com/DevilTea/uiux/discussions/379#discussioncomment-19257377"},{"relation":"opened-from","type":"view","viewId":"7f3d7780-3cb9-4e57-8f0b-2e8d569905c1"}],"requirements":["01a11bb1-b918-7cb5-b581-a3fd3f647f09"]},"variants":{"styles-conflict":{"state":{"style-1-down":{"disabled":false},"style-2-block":{"visible":true},"styles-conflict":{"visible":true},"styles-savebar":{"visible":true}}},"styles-edit":{"state":{"style-1-down":{"disabled":false},"style-2-block":{"visible":true},"styles-savebar":{"visible":true}}},"styles-invalid-specifier":{"state":{"style-1-down":{"disabled":false},"style-3-block":{"visible":true},"styles-savebar":{"visible":true}}},"styles-save-failed":{"state":{"style-1-down":{"disabled":false},"style-2-block":{"visible":true},"styles-error":{"visible":true},"styles-savebar":{"visible":true}}},"styles-theme-invalid-attribute":{"requirements":["01a139db-f0c9-74e8-b3e2-596b021ef929"],"state":{"styles-savebar":{"visible":true},"theme-invalid":{"visible":true},"themes-empty":{"visible":false}}},"styles-theme-map":{"requirements":["01a11bb1-ada4-7dd7-b3da-733de7a85df4"],"state":{"styles-savebar":{"visible":true},"styles-savebar-count-one":{"visible":false},"styles-savebar-count-two":{"visible":true},"theme-dark":{"visible":true},"theme-light":{"visible":true},"themes-empty":{"visible":false}}},"styles-theme-unknown":{"state":{"theme-contrast":{"visible":true},"themes-empty":{"visible":false}}}}}
